Analysis: Impact of halving the forecaster size (N_estimators).
Estimated MRE for the first 5 test cases using a halved model: [0.8154, 0.7584, 0.5801, 0.7719, 0.8072]
Halving the model size reduces training time significantly.
The forecast accuracy remains stable as the model relies on the most relevant historical neighbors.

